                            <th>Perspective</th>
                            <th>Core Focus</th>
                            <th>Explanation of Sam's Case</th>
                        </tr>
                    </thead>
                    <tbody>
                        <tr>
                            <td><strong>Psychodynamic</strong></td>
                            <td>Unconscious drives, childhood trauma, inner conflicts.</td>
                            <td>Unconscious aggressive urges or unresolved internal conflicts.</td>
                        </tr>
                        <tr>
                            <td><strong>Behavioral</strong></td>
                            <td>Environmental influences, rewards, punishments.</td>
                            <td>Sam learned this behavior through prior rewards or observation ("Black Box" approach).</td>
                        </tr>
                        <tr>
                            <td><strong>Humanistic</strong></td>
                            <td>Free will, personal growth, self-actualization.</td>
                            <td>Sam's expression of unfulfilled personal needs or choices.</td>
                        </tr>
                        <tr>
                            <td><strong>Cognitive</strong></td>
                            <td>Thinking, reasoning, problem-solving, memory.</td>
                            <td>Sam's internal processing, beliefs, or interpretations of the situation.</td>
                        </tr>
                        <tr>
                            <td><strong>Biological</strong></td>
                            <td>Brain structures, genetics, hormones, neurochemistry.</td>
                            <td>Hormonal levels, biological predisposition, or brain activity.</td>
                        </tr>
                        <tr>
                            <td><strong>Socio-cultural</strong></td>
                            <td>Cultural norms, group influences, social factors.</td>
                            <td>Cultural environment or group behavior expectations.</td>
                        </tr>
                    </tbody>
                </table>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

